   <p><b>Group average</b> (grey line) is the average for ${esc(peerWords(p).replace(/^other /,''))}; the colours show where that group sits. <b>National camp</b> (blue) is the average of players already seen at a national camp${anyCamp?` (${plural(anyCamp.n,kids)})`:''}.</p>
